{"schema":"rebang.page/1","platform":"jike","key":"all","page":1,"pages":3,"total":90,"has_more":true,"items":[{"id":"jike-BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6aff17fa38389f599301e5ce","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF","source_name":"刘飞Lufy","title":"","summary":"杭州的另外一些角落。","body":"杭州的另外一些角落。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6aff17fa38389f599301e5ce","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FnYykbICO4JRO-GgSFyXPZGtM61Ev3.jpg"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T23:38:34+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF","display_name":"刘飞Lufy","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FnYykbICO4JRO-GgSFyXPZGtM61Ev3.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FsWD9GqZbKTHIe_NgPhjkekl8fXdv3.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FlQuGB3J775kaLPpJ3NYatVqhflfv3.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FqSwSdLJtCqu9Ucct4iNps5Xu3pRv3.jpg"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FgT6fF6ajicCzhzz5Jmcxqhe0X5Sv3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-35224A78-8B11-469E-B307-16B58688FBEC:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afe85f8136b2761c60c518b","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-35224A78-8B11-469E-B307-16B58688FBEC","source_name":"艾逗笔","title":"","summary":"我最近半个月一直在用 t3code，主要原因是我把工作环境从原来的 mac pro 迁移到了家里的 mac mini，我需要一个可以跨设备操控 agent 的方案，t3 刚好能满足这个需求 t3 让我喜欢的几个点 1. 可以跨设备访问，有手机 app，可以随时操控其他设备上的 agent，出门不带电脑时，还能继续工作 2. 可以在同一对话切换 agent，能继承上下文，claude code 挂了…","body":"我最近半个月一直在用 t3code，主要原因是我把工作环境从原来的 mac pro 迁移到了家里的 mac mini，我需要一个可以跨设备操控 agent 的方案，t3 刚好能满足这个需求\n\nt3 让我喜欢的几个点\n\n1. 可以跨设备访问，有手机 app，可以随时操控其他设备上的 agent，出门不带电脑时，还能继续工作\n\n2. 可以在同一对话切换 agent，能继承上下文，claude code 挂了随时切换 codex，不影响工作\n\n3. GUI，视觉方面看起来比 TUI 要舒服一些\n\n其他像是状态通知、token 统计之类的功能我没怎么用，感触不深\n\n深入使用了半个月，我觉得 t3code 还是不太符合我的使用习惯，主要几点\n\n1. 跟 codex 一样的问题，按照文件夹组织项目，每个项目下只能挂一层的 session，并行 session 很多的情况下，切换起来很麻烦，GUI 占的视图太宽，基本上每个页面只能跑一个窗格\n\n2. 因为是 GUI，所以基本都是通过 ACP 去调度 agent，每次对话都有连接损耗，再加上跨设备组网延时，经常遇到 agent 连接中断的问题，很影响工作效率\n\n3. agent session 状态展示很迷，我经常不知道哪个任务跑到了什么状态，也很难快速感知和切换到需要我输入的 session\n\n最终还是决定换回使用 termany.sh\n\nTermany 最大的卖点是多层级文件树，workspace * page * tab * pane，我可以同时跑的 agent session 更多，一个窗口平铺显示多个 agent 对话，看起来更直观\n\nTermany 主要是 TUI，用的是 agent 的原生 cli，不需要通过 ACP 去连接，响应速度更快\n\nTermany 之前没有跨设备互联能力，影响外出时的开发效率，我写了个组网服务 nex\n\ngithub.com/thinkany-ai/nex\n\n解决了这个问题。\n\nTermany 没有手机 app，这个也在做了，配合组网服务，就能随时随地操控不同设备上的 agent\n\nTermany 还不支持在不同 agent 之间同步上下文，让 agent 可以无缝衔接工作\n\n等把手机 app 和跨 agent 共享上下文的功能做完，就再也没有使用 t3code 的理由了，termany.sh 真香。😍","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afe85f8136b2761c60c518b","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-19T13:15:36+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"35224A78-8B11-469E-B307-16B58688FBEC","display_name":"艾逗笔","media":[],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FoAURh6-IxhcgXHbHM2QZe1DIxg8v3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-35224A78-8B11-469E-B307-16B58688FBEC:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afe6dc3320fd7e1b577b7ad","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-35224A78-8B11-469E-B307-16B58688FBEC","source_name":"艾逗笔","title":"","summary":"https://termany.sh 云端互联版本来了，登录同一个 Termany 账号，实现跨设备互联，终端跑在家里的 mac mini 上，多任务并行，出门用另一台设备的 Termany 或者 web 版 https://termany.ai 访问，随处接入，无缝衔接，非常方便。","body":"https://termany.sh 云端互联版本来了，登录同一个 Termany 账号，实现跨设备互联，终端跑在家里的 mac mini 上，多任务并行，出门用另一台设备的 Termany 或者 web 版 https://termany.ai 访问，随处接入，无缝衔接，非常方便。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afe6dc3320fd7e1b577b7ad","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FvI29jJX3Xtw_lliWXUnKfbP-GpXv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T11:32:19+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"35224A78-8B11-469E-B307-16B58688FBEC","display_name":"艾逗笔","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FvI29jJX3Xtw_lliWXUnKfbP-GpXv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FoAURh6-IxhcgXHbHM2QZe1DIxg8v3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afdd9e3320fd7e1b568330d","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF","source_name":"刘飞Lufy","title":"","summary":"玩 GTA 6 不发图，如 _______。","body":"玩 GTA 6 不发图，如 _______。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afdd9e3320fd7e1b568330d","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/Fu2mZu1CiLmAfE0Ou4EeLrOAuOinv3.heic?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/format/jpeg/thumbnail/1080x%3E"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T01:01:23+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF","display_name":"刘飞Lufy","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/Fu2mZu1CiLmAfE0Ou4EeLrOAuOinv3.heic?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/format/jpeg/thumbnail/1080x%3E"},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FuA2cXHDD09MUI5idAaxb6LmG0y8v3.heic?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/format/jpeg/thumbnail/1080x%3E"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FgT6fF6ajicCzhzz5Jmcxqhe0X5Sv3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-bb668784-6bbc-456d-989c-1f8e90f6fd95:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afdd2123ce945612e8b2556","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-bb668784-6bbc-456d-989c-1f8e90f6fd95","source_name":"王帅真","title":"","summary":"GTA VI LET'S GO!!!","body":"GTA VI LET'S GO!!!","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afdd2123ce945612e8b2556","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FhJOF_fZiwisQFGHJMKhTiskM6PQv3.jpg"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T00:28:02+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"en","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"bb668784-6bbc-456d-989c-1f8e90f6fd95","display_name":"王帅真","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FhJOF_fZiwisQFGHJMKhTiskM6PQv3.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/Fg2lK7LQdEvqPt8D5E3QDMO0-NCFv3.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FqEd-rUVwoWXq130dnBBORrgCxRQv3.jpg"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FruN09TgXgxjfRo8YYmQd7nAo0g9v3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":true,"translation":{"title":"","summary":"《GTA VI》冲啊！！！","body":"《GTA VI》冲啊！！！","engine":"grok-bot","label":"机器翻译"}},{"id":"jike-83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afdce583ce945612e8abf10","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7","source_name":"Barret李靖","title":"","summary":"随着 AI 研发速度越来越快，整个研发流程中的中间产物会逐渐减少。 以前我们开完会，要把决策整理到 PRD 里，再更新技术方案，最后才进入代码开发。 但现在，很多决策在会议和群聊里就已经产生了，而且这些决策可以直接影响代码该怎么写。 那我们还有没有必要把这些内容重新整理成一份完整的 PRD，再让 AI 读一遍？ 当然可以，但很多时候这个过程可以省掉。 我们团队现在有些需求，讨论完之后直接进入开发，…","body":"随着 AI 研发速度越来越快，整个研发流程中的中间产物会逐渐减少。\n\n以前我们开完会，要把决策整理到 PRD 里，再更新技术方案，最后才进入代码开发。\n\n但现在，很多决策在会议和群聊里就已经产生了，而且这些决策可以直接影响代码该怎么写。\n\n那我们还有没有必要把这些内容重新整理成一份完整的 PRD，再让 AI 读一遍？\n\n当然可以，但很多时候这个过程可以省掉。\n\n我们团队现在有些需求，讨论完之后直接进入开发，AI 结合历史资料和沟通上下文完成实现。文档会根据协作和知识沉淀的需要再补充。\n\n所以我认为，未来知识入库会逐渐变成生产流程中的一条旁支链路。\n\n今天把活干完了，顺带把有价值的知识沉淀下来。\n\n尤其是大量只给 AI 消费的中间文档，可能会越来越少。人需要阅读和协作的内容，反而应该更加精简。\n\n当然，中间文档减少之后，质量怎么保障？\n\n这就要求我们把验收标准、自动化测试和工程约束做得更加完善。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afdce583ce945612e8abf10","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-19T00:12:08+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7","display_name":"Barret李靖","media":[],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/Fs-eSdFZY-o3eJCp506HPIEBqkXe?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afdcbbe3ce945612e8a77f5","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7","source_name":"Barret李靖","title":"","summary":"现在很多团队在建设 AI Native 研发体系，会把研发流程拆成很多节点，比如需求分析、技术设计、功能开发、埋点、测试、性能优化。 然后统计每个节点需要多少轮人机交互，想办法把原来的 10 轮压缩到 5 轮、3 轮，甚至 1 轮。 但我觉得有个问题值得思考。 假设这套流程已经可以全自动执行，那 AI 在内部循环多少轮，其实并没有那么重要。 有时候，AI 多尝试几轮，反而能够交付一个更正确、更有价…","body":"现在很多团队在建设 AI Native 研发体系，会把研发流程拆成很多节点，比如需求分析、技术设计、功能开发、埋点、测试、性能优化。\n\n然后统计每个节点需要多少轮人机交互，想办法把原来的 10 轮压缩到 5 轮、3 轮，甚至 1 轮。\n\n但我觉得有个问题值得思考。\n\n假设这套流程已经可以全自动执行，那 AI 在内部循环多少轮，其实并没有那么重要。\n\n有时候，AI 多尝试几轮，反而能够交付一个更正确、更有价值的东西。\n\n真正要关注的是，整个过程中人需要介入多少次，以及最终的交付质量怎么样。\n\n如果需求和验收标准都已经明确，AI 理论上就应该能够独立完成中间的执行过程。\n\n我们应该把更多精力放在需求理解和端到端验收这两侧，让 AI 自己去完成中间的工作。\n\n最终要优化的，是一个需求从提出到合格交付，究竟需要消耗多少人的注意力。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afdcbbe3ce945612e8a77f5","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-19T00:01:02+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7","display_name":"Barret李靖","media":[],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/Fs-eSdFZY-o3eJCp506HPIEBqkXe?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afdc4a658033097d75d7975","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF","source_name":"刘飞Lufy","title":"","summary":"杭州的一些角落。","body":"杭州的一些角落。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afdc4a658033097d75d7975","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FtwzKZHBvN6lWlQxb_p8hrz0X8kEv3.jpg"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T23:30:46+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF","display_name":"刘飞Lufy","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FtwzKZHBvN6lWlQxb_p8hrz0X8kEv3.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FjISBbkpOvRAWXFTDecGMxassBH5v3.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FlLx1YDHuNOc64ki1ZkSk2nDNUW7v3.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FvpJ-W5H5q7TOur3VGRsPnYNdi0Dv3.jpg"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FgT6fF6ajicCzhzz5Jmcxqhe0X5Sv3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afdbfb438389f5993dc3aab","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7","source_name":"Barret李靖","title":"","summary":"我觉得未来的企业数字员工，需要有自己的身份、权限和职责，真正成为团队的工作伙伴。 现在很多 Agent 还是借用人的身份做事情，你问一句，它答一句；你安排一个任务，它执行一个任务。 但数字员工应该可以主动参与协同。 比如，它知道团队有哪些成员，每个人负责什么项目，当前有哪些任务、目标和问题。 当它发现线上异常，可以自己排查原因，给出解决方案，甚至提交 PR，然后主动找到对应的同学评审。 当它发现缺…","body":"我觉得未来的企业数字员工，需要有自己的身份、权限和职责，真正成为团队的工作伙伴。\n\n现在很多 Agent 还是借用人的身份做事情，你问一句，它答一句；你安排一个任务，它执行一个任务。\n\n但数字员工应该可以主动参与协同。\n\n比如，它知道团队有哪些成员，每个人负责什么项目，当前有哪些任务、目标和问题。\n\n当它发现线上异常，可以自己排查原因，给出解决方案，甚至提交 PR，然后主动找到对应的同学评审。\n\n当它发现缺少权限，可以向项目负责人申请授权；当任务需要人工决策，可以主动找到负责人确认。\n\n它可以参与群聊、接收任务、同步进展、跟踪结果，也可以在问题解决之后主动通知用户。\n\n我们要慢慢让 AI 走进团队的生产协同里，给它真实的工作职责，让它承担越来越多的事情。\n\n你会发现，很多过去需要人去推动的工作，开始由 AI 自己完成了。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afdbfb438389f5993dc3aab","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-18T23:09:40+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7","display_name":"Barret李靖","media":[],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/Fs-eSdFZY-o3eJCp506HPIEBqkXe?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afdb5393ce945612e87fd7e","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","source_name":"少楠Plidezus","title":"","summary":"偶然看到： 麦子自秦朝以来，也就成熟了 2000 多次。","body":"偶然看到：\n\n麦子自秦朝以来，也就成熟了 2000 多次。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afdb5393ce945612e87fd7e","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/LPFj0ovo2Ss9glUcOFqh--POlA3EZl.heic?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/format/jpeg/thumbnail/1080x%3E"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T22:24:57+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"7B1385A9-FCC9-4446-B8CE-472EAF6817B2","display_name":"少楠Plidezus","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/LPFj0ovo2Ss9glUcOFqh--POlA3EZl.heic?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/format/jpeg/thumbnail/1080x%3E"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FmtwuafewTTtdX3XezBXlN2OsOvDv3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afdb2c458033097d75b7c34","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7","source_name":"Barret李靖","title":"","summary":"程序员需要逐渐接受一个现实，未来很多编程工作会变成黑盒编程。 我们团队有不少系统是用 Rust 写的，但真正精通 Rust 的人并不多。有些系统很复杂，承载着高并发、高流量的业务，我们仍然敢让 AI 去开发。 为什么？ 因为我们开始把更多精力放在需求、架构约束和验收标准上。系统应该具备什么能力，性能和稳定性要达到什么水位，哪些安全规范必须遵守，哪些测试必须通过，这些事情需要提前定义清楚。 至于代码…","body":"程序员需要逐渐接受一个现实，未来很多编程工作会变成黑盒编程。\n\n我们团队有不少系统是用 Rust 写的，但真正精通 Rust 的人并不多。有些系统很复杂，承载着高并发、高流量的业务，我们仍然敢让 AI 去开发。\n\n为什么？\n\n因为我们开始把更多精力放在需求、架构约束和验收标准上。系统应该具备什么能力，性能和稳定性要达到什么水位，哪些安全规范必须遵守，哪些测试必须通过，这些事情需要提前定义清楚。\n\n至于代码具体怎么写、函数怎么组织，很多时候可以交给 AI。\n\n当然，架构设计还是要关注，尤其是复杂的重系统。只不过，工程师不需要再盯着每一行代码、每一个实现细节。\n\n我们真正需要做的事情，是深入理解业务想要什么，为什么要做，以及如何建立一套可靠的工程体系，让 AI 能够持续交付。\n\n写代码这件事情，正在逐渐从工程师的核心工作中退出。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afdb2c458033097d75b7c34","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-18T22:14:28+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7","display_name":"Barret李靖","media":[],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/Fs-eSdFZY-o3eJCp506HPIEBqkXe?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-bb668784-6bbc-456d-989c-1f8e90f6fd95:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afda8993ce945612e8687b7","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-bb668784-6bbc-456d-989c-1f8e90f6fd95","source_name":"王帅真","title":"","summary":"我现在订阅了御四家了： 1. Claude Pro 20刀 2. GPT Plus 20刀 3. Gemini Pro 20刀 4. GrokBot Premium 30刀 90刀，再配点 ds api + workbuddy 免费额度随便混一混，主打一个成年人不做选择题。","body":"我现在订阅了御四家了：\n\n1. Claude Pro 20刀\n\n2. GPT Plus 20刀\n\n3. Gemini Pro 20刀\n\n4. GrokBot Premium 30刀\n\n90刀，再配点 ds api + workbuddy 免费额度随便混一混，主打一个成年人不做选择题。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afda8993ce945612e8687b7","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-18T21:31:05+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"bb668784-6bbc-456d-989c-1f8e90f6fd95","display_name":"王帅真","media":[],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FruN09TgXgxjfRo8YYmQd7nAo0g9v3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-bb668784-6bbc-456d-989c-1f8e90f6fd95:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afd1b95136b2761c6e4c4b3","kind":"post","channel":null,